WEBVTT

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:45.330
Battles between women are 
climactic clashes of pride.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:55.340
<b>The Warring Chef Triad</b>

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.720
But let's go back a few hours first.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:02.080
Boy, camping's a blast!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.870
Nothing like spending 
a summer roughing it!

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:08.620
Hey, this is supposed to be 
part of our survival training.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:10.190
Don't get complacent!

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.710
We're being complacent?

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:14.190
What makes you say that?

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.890
Your entire existence!

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:18.300
And save the sunscreen for the beach!

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:21.080
Camping's so troublesome.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.870
Especially cooking for yourself.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:28.050
It's certainly going to be difficult 
to cook for this many of us.

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:31.260
If we don't catch any fish,
we don't get to eat tonight, right?

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.500
Finally, I got one!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.920
The girls are in the mountains 
looking for food,

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.570
if we can't catch enough for everyone...

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:42.890
...they'll rip us a new one.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:45.890
Do girls even rip them?

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.380
Everyone rips them.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:52.400
Put a cork in it, you two!

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.320
He said rip us a new one, not rip one!

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:56.930
Delivering all the punchlines by myself...

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:59.330
...is making me appreciate 
the girls more and more.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:02.200
Appreciate the girls...

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.240
Oh, right!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.160
We should ask the women to 
handle preparing the food!

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.990
No, first we have to catch 
enough fish for everyone.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:17.180
We can't make them do everything.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:20.090
Don't make us do all the work 
just because we're girls!

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.760
Yeah, really!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.220
That's exactly what'll happen.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.010
The three of them are very
proud girls, it'll be difficult.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.950
Ah ha, pride...

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.610
You just gave me an idea.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.410
They're still gone?

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.330
Maybe they didn't catch any fish?

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:41.780
Give me a break!

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:44.500
I'm telling you you're wrong!

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.530
What is it?!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:49.910
We're deciding who's going 
to cook the fish we caught.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.170
Everyone's biased for their own teammate,

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.630
and things are getting a bit heated.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.590
No one cooks like Sakura, 
she's the best there is!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.550
<i>She's the best there is...</i>

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.970
No way! Tenten's definitely better!

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.470
<i>Tenten's definitely better...</i>

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.600
Hey, what about me?!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.210
Oh, you guys, cut it out.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:15.900
I appreciate the compliment, 
but there's no need to fight.

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:18.940
I bet Tenten can only make Chinese food!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.900
Sakura's too clumsy. 
She'll only be able to do a roast!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.020
Come on, guys, stop.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:29.160
Fighting won't help.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.450
You're wrong!

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.580
Tenten can make more than Chinese food.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:39.000
Making cup ramen has nothing 
to do with cooking!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:44.340
Sakura can do more with 
fish than roast it whole!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:47.050
That's not even edible yet!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.890
Does it really matter?

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.850
Against Ino,
 you'd be comparing garbage to sewage.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:55.670
<i>Against Ino...</i>

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.520
Hey, that's all I get?!

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.640
All right, I'm not 
letting that one slide!

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.530
Me neither!

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:02.750
Lee...

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:03.360
Naruto...

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:06.390
Who's the garbage and who's the sewage?

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:08.620
The garbage is technically better!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.540
You're not objecting?

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.370
As long as it's edible, I don't 
care if it's a little grody.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.300
Choji!

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.230
Let's pause, okay?

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:25.800
What're you saying exactly?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.510
It sounds like none of you 
think we can cook for squat.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:33.720
Oh, we don't think, we're sure of it.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:39.560
Sai!

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.580
All right.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:44.190
We'll show you how well we can cook.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.070
And who's the best at it, too.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.790
Then let's do it like this:

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:54.060
Make us something from the food 
you gathered in the mountains.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.010
Whoever's dish gets the most votes wins.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:57.750
Sound good?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:05.890
Agreed!

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:10.320
And thus, the three girls go to war!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.540
<i>Mind-Body Switch jutsu.</i>

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:39.190
Who knew Shikamaru's plan 
would work so perfectly?

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.980
They're very prideful girls,

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.460
take advantage of that and
they're like puppets on a string.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.340
We're sort of tricking them though...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.660
I feel a bit guilty.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.250
I hear ya...

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.430
But this way we get to eat 
Sakura's home cooking.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:00.970
Hooray for Sakura's cooking!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.670
Hooray, hooray!

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.660
Hooray for Shikamaru's plan!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:05.940
Hooray, hooray!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.430
Hooray for Sakura's apron!

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:10.900
Hooray, hooray, hooray, hooray!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.350
Those two are so positive they 
could live through Armageddon.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.280
Yeah.

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:20.900
The competition between the girls
shall be one sixty minute round.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:21.580
Begin!

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:24.570
It's an all-female cooking showdown.

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.370
How do you see it playing out, 
color commentator Nejiyama?

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:28.510
Nejiyama?!

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:31.660
Their skills are more or less equal.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:35.930
The competition is going to come down
to who found the best ingredients.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:36.910
Well put.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.970
Much like how no amount 
of makeup can make...

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.210
...an ugly woman look better 
than a natural beauty.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.450
That made no sense.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:44.860
It's hard to be a woman.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.790
Reporting from the kitchen!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:51.580
Sakura appears to be making 
a fish curry at her station.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.450
Sounds quite delicious.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.320
Reporting from the kitchen.

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.410
Our station's prepping a beef curry.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.480
Another curry dish... 
The competition is heating up.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.340
Reporting from the kitchen!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.040
The fruit is very tart and very sweet!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.800
Who said you could taste test?!

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:12.080
It seems all three chefs 
are making curry.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:14.720
The ingredients will have a 
huge impact on the outcome.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:17.070
Whoa, reporting from the kitchen!

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:20.310
Sakura's taking it to the next 
level and adding lobster!

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.730
I thought the rule was to only use
ingredients found on the mountain.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:26.330
It just happened to be 
swimming up a waterfall.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:27.530
Reporting.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:31.190
Ino's got Black Wagyu beef
 that costs 1500 yen per gram.

00:08:33.590 --> 00:08:35.740
It just happened to 
be out rock climbing.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.390
Yeah, right! Besides, the 
price tag's still on!

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:40.000
Reporting from the kitchen!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.140
I'm taking it to the next level, too!

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.830
Suppress your appetite for once!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:48.470
It appears Chef Tenten hasn't
brought in any new ingredients.

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:51.830
Unless she's got something to
counter lobster and premium beef,

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.260
she doesn't stand a chance.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:58.010
Chef Tenten has just tossed in a large
number of habanero peppers!

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.260
I bought them at the grocery store 
at the foot of the mountain.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.730
Don't be so honest! At least 
come up with an excuse!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.190
Lee likes spicy food.

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:08.480
Um... I can only stand so much spice...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.550
What the heck are you doing, Sakura?!

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:14.900
I hate spicy foods.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.110
That's not what I meant...

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:19.950
Shoot, I'm gonna lose!

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:24.080
No way, you're winning by 
a mile after all that.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:27.590
I'll just have to triple...

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:30.070
...my secret ingredient to
three tablespoons of chakra!

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.880
What does that even taste like?

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:35.530
I'll show you, I'll 
add four tablespoons!

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.470
I'll add a whole bowl!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.970
This is madness!

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:40.900
I'll make chakra soup!

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:43.040
I'll make chakra stew!

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.930
Chakra combo platter, beat that!

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.310
Bon appétit!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.920
<i>I wonder what it'll taste like...</i>

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.290
<i>It looks so gross.</i>

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.520
Eat up.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.360
It's delicious!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:19.840
<b>Delicious Wish</b>

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:26.180
It's out of this world!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.180
<b>Big Fish!!</b>

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.170
I don't believe it.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:30.960
Glad you like it.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.750
You fools.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.430
We put a ton of chakra in, after all.

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:53.310
Bet you thought you had us dancing 
in the palm of your hands.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.550
"Hooray" for what, again?

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.260
<i>Hooray for Sakura's cooking!</i>

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.050
<i>Hooray, hooray!</i>

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:05.010
You're going to eat every 
last bite of curry.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:11.980
In today's competition, 
the men lost big!

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:20.930
Early to bed, early 
to rise and all that,

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:23.430
are you an early bird, too?

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:26.850
Today, Rock Lee is...

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:29.330
Off to radio calisthenics!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.100
It's too early to be so energetic.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:34.250
You're too high strung, Lee.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.030
Of course I am.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.710
Radio calisthenics are 
a hallmark of summer,

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:43.250
like going to the mountains 
and the ocean!

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:46.260
It's that big a deal?

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.050
No, there's more.

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:51.480
This year Guy Sensei is in 
charge of the exercises!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.560
Oh, that again.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:59.940
<i>Lee, I came up with a new 
method of radio calisthenics.</i>

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.640
<i>Look forward to it!</i>

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:02.420
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.370
<i>Guy Sensei, you're really excited, huh?</i>

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:08.880
<i>Yeah! I'll show everyone what being
a hot-blooded youth is all about!</i>

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.830
<i>You're too hot to handle, Guy Sensei!</i>

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.760
<i>Let's swim to the opposite shore!</i>

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.340
<i>I won't lose!</i>

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:22.840
This will not end well.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.840
How can you say that, Tenten?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.710
We're his pupils, we have to support him!

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:29.810
<i>Raise both arms high in the air!</i>

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.990
Oh, it's already started.

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:33.030
Let's hurry!

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:34.740
It's already started.

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:37.560
<i>And one, two, three, four...</i>

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.270
<i>One...</i>

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:45.070
<i>One, two, three, four...</i>

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:55.080
<b>Time to Tone Down Guy Sensei!</b>

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.100
It's hot enough this summer,

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:59.130
and you want me to 
exercise with Guy Sensei?

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.920
Just thinking about it makes me sweaty.

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:03.340
Sorry, he's a little... intense.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.840
I hate getting up early.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.070
You'd burn a whole 
day's worth of calories...

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:11.430
...if you ran into Guy first 
thing in the morning.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:14.100
Too troublesome, don't wanna go.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:17.400
Sorry, I'm trying to think.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.270
Beef over rice or rice over beef?

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.460
Well, they've all got their reasons,

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:26.580
but it looks like no one wants 
to go to radio calisthenics.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:31.410
A lot of the reasons seem to be
related to Guy Sensei's personality.

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.750
Well, if no one's going to come,

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.920
Guy Sensei probably won't bother either.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:41.380
<i>Raise your arms over your head
as we stretch out the chakra.</i>

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.300
<i>And one, two, three, four...</i>

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.610
Guy Sensei?

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:50.830
What? Why am I still doing the 
radio calisthenics class?

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:51.870
Yes.

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:57.770
It just seems pointless for you to
keep going alone if no one shows up.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:03.910
Yeah... It's true no one wants 
to come exercise with me.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:06.280
Plus, it is almost August.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:10.860
August is when everyone either
goes back to their hometowns,

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:13.950
or leaves for their dream vacation.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.970
No, this isn't a dream!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:18.330
It's gonna give me nightmares!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:22.270
Everyone's probably forgotten 
I'm even out here,

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.040
doing calisthenics every morning.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.340
Please, help me forget what I just saw.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:32.290
And yet, someone may still 
chance upon this spot.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:35.200
Maybe even tomorrow.

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:39.190
As long as there's a chance that
even one person will show up,

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.560
my radio and I will be right here.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.160
So that's why?

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:47.190
I understand.

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:50.330
Leave everything to us!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.970
We'll think of a way to get 
people to come to your classes.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:57.160
And we'll repair this fragile, 
nearly broken calisthenics class!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.350
Lee...

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:02.380
I've... I've got such wonderful students!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.350
Guy Sensei...

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.630
Guy Sensei!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:14.300
For God's sakes, it's hot enough 
out here, stop this craziness!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:19.230
Let's start by looking deeper 
at the answers we got.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:23.730
Yeah, their responses 
should help us think.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.550
We'll start with her.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.980
It's hot enough this summer,

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.020
and you want me to 
exercise with Guy Sensei?

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:32.150
Just thinking about it makes me sweaty.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.700
It's true.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.110
The three of us are used to it,

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:37.450
but to a normal person,

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.580
Guy Sensei's hot-bloodedness 
is overwhelming.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.500
Are you okay, Guy Sensei?!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.750
Y-Yeah...

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.380
Just got nailed with a verbal 
wind-style jutsu, that's all.,

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.930
You already look totally heartbroken...

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:58.310
So anyway, we need a way 
to cool Guy Sensei down.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:15:59.430
I suggest...

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.020
A giant fan!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.940
If we point this at him the 
temperature will drop right away!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:08.230
You're talking about 
physical temperature?

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:10.440
Moving on to the next response.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.410
Sorry, he's a little... intense.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:18.200
The three of us are used to it,

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:22.210
but to a normal person, 
Guy Sensei's intensity is ridiculous.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:28.130
Are you okay, Guy Sensei?!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.170
Yeah...

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.130
Just got nailed with a verbal 
water-style jutsu, that's all.

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:34.590
You already look totally beaten!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:37.850
So we need to lighten him up.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.060
I suggest...

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:42.270
A sheer, free-flowing outfit!

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:44.480
They weren't talking about his clothing!

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.810
Then how about this?

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.980
Somehow that's even more intense!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.300
And finally, there's this one.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:55.400
You'd burn a whole day's worth of calories...

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:58.760
...if you ran into Guy first
thing in the morning.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.500
The three of us are used to it,

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.050
but to a normal person,

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:07.460
Guy Sensei's a lot to 
deal with in the morning.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.110
Huh?

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.840
Guy Sensei!

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:16.610
So essentially, 
Kakashi Sensei was saying...

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:20.400
...that one should avoid 
Guy Sensei in the morning.

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:21.270
I suggest...

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.000
The class be at night!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.460
He just looks like a tired old man.

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.680
Things are nice and 
cool this way, right?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:35.820
So cool I've got the chills...
 from the creepiness.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.080
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:46.730
It looks like I needed my 
students to save me for once.

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:48.380
No, we haven't saved you at all!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:52.050
We've made your situation even shakier!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.630
Look, we've done all we can.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:57.900
Where does all that 
confidence come from?

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:59.000
It'll be fine,

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.060
we just need to wait for 
everyone to show up!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:02.560
Yeah!

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.280
But, just as Tenten feared,

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.710
no one showed up to do 
calisthenics with Guy Sensei.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.870
It's hard enough to get to 
sleep on summer nights,

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.010
and you want me to 
exercise with Guy Sensei?

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.990
Just thinking about 
it gives me insomnia.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.740
Sorry, he's a little...intense.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.250
I don't stay up late.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.290
You'd double all the stress and...

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.670
...exhaustion of the day if 
you ran into Guy at night.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:34.420
Too troublesome, don't wanna go.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.070
Sorry, I'm trying to think.

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:38.700
Should I stuff the beef 
in the rice balls,

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:41.100
or wrap them with it?

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:46.270
I wonder what we're doing wrong.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.180
Maybe we over-learned the 
lessons of history...

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:51.630
I guess this is what it means to 
be hoisted by your own petard.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.820
Oh, we're hoisted all right.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.850
We're hoisted, hosed, and hopeless.

00:18:56.850 --> 00:19:00.880
The three of us should keep 
showing up, at least.

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:02.860
Wait, you've got it all wrong!

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:04.860
I don't think I do.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:07.400
We received a report of a weird 
character in the area.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:09.780
I'm just doing radio calisthenics!

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:12.750
Yeah, yeah, you can tell 
us down at the station.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:13.580
Excessive force!

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:14.930
You stinkin' pigs!

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:17.800
I know your type.
 You're all cowards on the inside!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.590
<b>Might Guy</b>

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:24.640
<b>Leaf Police Department</b>

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:25.870
You've done your time.

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:28.120
No more funny business, okay?

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.140
Yes, sir.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:32.240
No one's waiting for you?

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:33.530
I...

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:34.710
Uh...

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:36.780
I have to go.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:38.500
I have to...

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:40.820
Go where?

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.210
Radio calisthenics.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.400
You guys...

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:05.850
I'm sorry, Guy Sensei.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.900
I... I...

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:10.070
I should be apologizing to you.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.690
You've all been waiting for me,

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.610
and I couldn't come run 
the calisthenics class.

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:17.120
Guy Sensei...

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:19.530
It wasn't just them.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:27.960
The three of them have been 
running all over the village,

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:31.960
rounding up people to meet 
you when you got out.

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:35.830
I...

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:39.880
I have such wonderful pupils!

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:43.310
Well, you seem a lot more toned-down,

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:45.670
so I guess we can get through this 
without burning too many calories.

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:47.890
Okay, Guy Sensei!

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:51.850
Show us the new and improved
calisthenics you created, Guy Sensei!

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:54.400
Okay, here we go!

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:58.730
<i>Now, raise your hands high in the air,</i>

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:02.740
<i>and let's shake and wave 
our way to a good sweat!</i>

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.700
And, up!

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:10.980
Now, grab a torch and 
keep to the rhythm,

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:12.710
and dance, dance, dance!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.550
And up!

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:30.310
Huh?

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:33.760
They waited for Guy to get out of jail,

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:37.880
but skipped out before he 
finished his weird exercises.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:41.150
Hang in there, Guy! Keep fighting, Guy!

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:28.470
<b>Road to Guy!
The Amazing True Story of the
Leaf Village Film Festival!</b>

00:23:22.390 --> 00:23:24.930
Next week is "Road to Guy!"

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:28.470
and "The Amazing True Story of 
the Leaf Village Film Festival!"

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:30.690
Tell me, Tenten, what 
do you think of this?

00:23:30.690 --> 00:23:31.300
Huh?

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:33.270
"I, Rock Lee, was grateful for the chance...

00:23:33.270 --> 00:23:36.600
...to play a hero who protects 
Sakura from evildoers,

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.540
but even more so to be able 
to play her lover as well..."

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:41.310
What is this?

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:43.900
I'm preparing an acceptance 
speech just in case.

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:45.220
You don't need an acceptance speech,

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:46.960
there's no movie like that!
